{
  "source": "course-assets/whats-an-llm/whats-an-llm.mp4",
  "duration": 156.416,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.32,
      "text": "If you've spent any time with AI lately, you've probably used an application like"
    },
    {
      "start": 4.32,
      "end": 6.62,
      "text": "ChatGPT, Clod, or Gemini."
    },
    {
      "start": 7.38,
      "end": 9.44,
      "text": "But those interfaces are just the surface."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.06,
      "end": 14.88,
      "text": "Under the hood, doing the actual mathematical work is something called a large language"
    },
    {
      "start": 14.88,
      "end": 16.28,
      "text": "model, or LLM."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.98,
      "end": 18.88,
      "text": "This graphic breaks down what that means."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.68,
      "end": 23.6,
      "text": "Large means the model was exposed to massive amounts of text and code."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.6,
      "end": 25.74,
      "text": "Language describes what it does."
    },
    {
      "start": 26.32,
      "end": 29.72,
      "text": "Reads, writes, summarizes, translates, and explains."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.66,
      "end": 33.32,
      "text": "A model predicts the likely output from learned patterns."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.2,
      "end": 35.38,
      "text": "ChatGPT is the app."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.8,
      "end": 37.24,
      "text": "The LLM is the engine."
    },
    {
      "start": 38.1,
      "end": 39.46,
      "text": "Before you ever type a prompt,"
    },
    {
      "start": 39.86,
      "end": 41.68,
      "text": "the model goes through a phase called training."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.34,
      "end": 44.08,
      "text": "It digests enormous amounts of data"
    },
    {
      "start": 44.08,
      "end": 46.08,
      "text": "to build a vast mental library"
    },
    {
      "start": 46.08,
      "end": 48.58,
      "text": "of structural and cultural language patterns."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.36,
      "end": 50.18,
      "text": "Take a look at this board."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.64,
      "end": 52.74,
      "text": "It illustrates a pattern you picked up as a child."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.74,
      "end": 57.08,
      "text": "If I say peanut butter and, you instantly know the next word is jelly."
    },
    {
      "start": 57.76,
      "end": 60.96,
      "text": "You know it, and because of its training, the AI knows it too."
    },
    {
      "start": 61.62,
      "end": 63.6,
      "text": "These familiar sequences are everywhere."
    },
    {
      "start": 64.24,
      "end": 65.88,
      "text": "Twinkle, twinkle, little star."
    },
    {
      "start": 66.56,
      "end": 69.14,
      "text": "Once upon a time, you automatically fill in the blank."
    },
    {
      "start": 69.72,
      "end": 71.36,
      "text": "Better late than leads to never."
    },
    {
      "start": 72.14,
      "end": 75.1,
      "text": "The AI also learns complex structural patterns."
    },
    {
      "start": 75.56,
      "end": 77.6,
      "text": "By working through billions of examples,"
    },
    {
      "start": 77.92,
      "end": 80.78,
      "text": "it maps how humans explain ideas, solve problems,"
    },
    {
      "start": 80.78,
      "end": 87.02,
      "text": "write code, and make spelling errors. When you ask a question, the model uses those learned patterns"
    },
    {
      "start": 87.02,
      "end": 92.0,
      "text": "and the words already there to work out what could come next. It chooses a likely next word,"
    },
    {
      "start": 92.38,
      "end": 97.98,
      "text": "adds it, and repeats. The words already there change what might come next. Peanut butter and"
    },
    {
      "start": 97.98,
      "end": 103.46,
      "text": "might lead to jelly. Peanut butter and banana might lead to sandwich. Your smartphone does"
    },
    {
      "start": 103.46,
      "end": 107.68,
      "text": "something very similar when you write a text message. It suggests a word, you tap it,"
    },
    {
      "start": 107.68,
      "end": 109.64,
      "text": "and then it calculates the next suggestion"
    },
    {
      "start": 109.64,
      "end": 110.82,
      "text": "based on what you just added."
    },
    {
      "start": 111.4,
      "end": 113.88,
      "text": "This diagram shows how an LLM scales the process."
    },
    {
      "start": 114.42,
      "end": 116.68,
      "text": "It starts with, I want to buy peanut butter and,"
    },
    {
      "start": 117.06,
      "end": 118.78,
      "text": "predicts jelly, adds it,"
    },
    {
      "start": 119.14,
      "end": 121.2,
      "text": "then uses the new sentence to predict for,"
    },
    {
      "start": 121.64,
      "end": 122.5,
      "text": "and finally lunch."
    },
    {
      "start": 123.08,
      "end": 125.14,
      "text": "It doesn't retrieve a pre-written file."
    },
    {
      "start": 125.6,
      "end": 129.38,
      "text": "It chooses a word, updates context, and predicts again."
    },
    {
      "start": 130.02,
      "end": 133.08,
      "text": "As the answer grows, every newly generated word"
    },
    {
      "start": 133.08,
      "end": 135.0,
      "text": "gets pulled back into the engine."
    },
    {
      "start": 135.0,
      "end": 141.08,
      "text": "It actively becomes part of the mathematical context used to calculate the very next prediction."
    },
    {
      "start": 141.78,
      "end": 146.08,
      "text": "More than one word can fit, so the same starting text can lead to different answers."
    },
    {
      "start": 146.74,
      "end": 153.0,
      "text": "Training builds the patterns. The model uses those patterns to build your answer, one word at a time."
    }
  ],
